OL,3,GNEWSAHow do you farm a protected
OL,4,Alandscape?
OL,5,
OL,6,FStanding in the Shropshire Hills, Rob
OL,7,Fand Sarah Davies face a challenge
OL,8,Ffamiliar to farmers across England's
OL,9,Fprotected landscapes.
OL,11,FThey need to run a profitable farm
OL,12,Fwhile protecting nature, welcoming
OL,13,Fvisitors and managing land that is
OL,14,Foften difficult to farm.
OL,16,FFor the couple, who keep 35 Highland
OL,17,Fcattle and 900 sheep at Blackhurst Farm
OL,18,Fnear Longnor, that balancing act has
OL,19,Fbecome increasingly important as
OL,20,Ffarmers are asked to produce food, help
OL,21,Fwildlife recover and adapt to a
OL,22,Fchanging climate.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
